+    Codex rotates subscription credentials while it runs. A symlink from task scratch to the
+    operator's auth file becomes read-only under the certified sandbox and makes a healthy
+    long-running factory fail as soon as the access token expires. Seed one factory-owned copy
+    from the operator login, once, and never copy it back. The copy lives under runtime state,
+    is excluded from project worktrees, and is mounted writable only for OpenAI-capable agents.
+    Subsequent calls preserve the factory copy so refresh-token rotation survives task changes.
     """
